t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI紧急开启300亿美元融资，估值目标冲向1.4万亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI升级ChatGPT浏览器扩展，支持跨标签页读取与自动化操作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">MiniMax发布M3.1Flash模型：成本降低70%且推理速度提升近3倍</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵开源Ming-3.0语音系列模型，涵盖合成、识别与理解</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce5e7a37c4df079f49f51442d612da0b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁百灵正式开源Ming-3.0语音系列，共包含五款模型，全面覆盖语音合成（TTS）、音频理解与对话、语音识别（ASR）三大核心能力。开发者可根据任务需求灵活调用或组合使用。在语音合成方面，Ming-3.0-tts系列支持文本描述音色及参考音频设定，并创新引入“导演模式”，允许创作者精细化控制台词的情绪起伏、重读与节奏。音频理解模型Ming-3.0-audio-flash与tiny专为长音频设计，支持转写、总结及观点分析，能有效保留对话中的情绪、说话人身份及环境信息。语音识别模型Ming-3.0-asr-tiny通过优化语料分布及结合语言模型基座的上下文理解能力，显著提升了在方言、领域热词等复杂场景下的识别准确率。目前，该系列能力已在蚂蚁内部的阿福App、医生助手、支付宝搜索及安全核身等多个业务场景中落地应用，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊开源TorchNeuron工具，实现PyTorch代码在Trainium芯片原生运行</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c25f1e864b1a596375dec22d63938321.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊于10月19日正式推出开源工具TorchNeuron，旨在打破英伟达CUDA生态垄断，实现PyTorch代码在亚马逊自研Trainium芯片上的无缝迁移。开发者无需重写代码，仅需修改一处配置参数，即可在Trainium上运行现有的PyTorch训练脚本。测试显示，该方案在保持模型学习内容与训练速度一致的前提下，允许开发者直接复用原有的测试、调试及扩展工具。亚马逊通过参与PyTorch上游开发，致力于推动框架的“硬件无关化”，降低开发者对特定GPU生态的依赖。此举不仅为Trainium芯片铺路，更通过开源策略为行业提供芯片切换的灵活性，旨在通过降低迁移成本与技术门槛，在算力市场中构建更具竞争力的开发生态。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI紧急开启300亿美元融资，估值目标冲向1.4万亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正加速推进新一轮融资，计划筹集约300亿美元资金，旨在竞争对手Anthropic预计于11月中旬IPO前锁定资本市场份额。若融资顺利，OpenAI估值将达到1.4万亿美元。目前，软银集团、阿布扎比MGX及现有投资方正就此进行深度洽谈。此次融资节奏异常迅速，核心动机在于应对AI领域激烈的资本争夺，并为高额的基础设施投入提供支撑。对于OpenAI而言，这笔巨额资金不仅能巩固其在ChatGPT及新模型发布后的市场领先地位，还能在未来资本市场波动时，为原定2027年的上市计划提供现金流缓冲。面对两家AI独角兽的融资竞争，投资者需在极短时间内完成评估与决策，AI行业的资本博弈已进入白热化阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI升级ChatGPT浏览器扩展，支持跨标签页读取与自动化操作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d94ae718c271947526bf3fae3a9e6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日对Chrome浏览器ChatGPT扩展程序进行重大升级，引入“计算机使用”（computer use）能力，并向所有套餐用户开放。此次更新将插件功能划分为Chat与Work两种模式：Chat模式具备跨标签页读取能力，可自动汇拢多个网页的上下文信息并进行数据抽取与分析；Work模式则具备自动化操作权限，支持接管标签页执行下载文件、发送消息、填写表单及智能分组等复杂工作流。此外，侧边栏已打通历史记录与已连接插件，支持在浏览网页的同时并行处理文本摘要、邮件撰写及跨平台数据提报。此次升级标志着ChatGPT从单纯的信息检索助手向具备网页端原生工作流控制力的Agent转型，通过深度整合浏览器环境，显著降低了多源信息整合与重复性任务的操作门槛，实现了对桌面端生产力闭环的深度介入。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax发布M3.1Flash模型：成本降低70%且推理速度提升近3倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f1855b6a6cfdba99ac9f482252cfd6e1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">MiniMax于10月19日正式更新新一代Flash模型M3.1Flash，该模型在Agentic任务、编程、Computer Use及网络安全领域实现代际提升。性能方面，M3.1Flash在OSWorld V2与ALE评测中均位列国产模型第一，DeepSWE v1.1得分73.7%，CyberGym基准得分82%。模型采用稀疏注意力架构，日常输出速度可达200+ TPS，P50中位数稳定在170+ TPS。成本方面，输入价格为1元/百万Token，输出为4元/百万Token，缓存读取为0.1元/百万Token，综合使用成本较前代降低70%。该模型已上线MiniMax API、MPlan与MiniMax Code，支持跨SaaS系统的复杂业务流处理及多步骤金融规划。此次更新延续了Flash系列以效率换能力的产品</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
